(text "ISOLATION BARRIER: U3, K1, U2, PS1 (and T1) straddle it; keep at least 6 mm creepage across it" (at 20.32 112.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid caf0f8cf-bd39-4ffd-813d-d3a7d0727cf5))
(text "MAINS IN, FUSE, SURGE; OUTLET (LIGHT always on, MOTOR controlled)" (at 20.32 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5cf18311-76fb-49fe-84e6-c97901826112))
